  "number": 482,
  "title": "Virtualize the pull request list and cache row search text",
  "url": "https://github.com/t3tools/t3code/pull/482",
  "body": "## What\n\nThe pull requests page filtered every row on each keystroke by lower-casing five fields. This builds the search text once per row when an answer arrives and virtualizes the list.\n\n- Rows keep a cached `haystack` and parsed timestamps\n- Grouping reuses `Arc` rows instead of cloning entries\n- The stack column reads membership from the row\n\n## Measured\n\n| rows | before | after |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2,000 | 9.8 ms | 0.6 ms |\n\nCloses #455 :tada:",
